\begin_layout Standard
Note, from step three of the proof, 
\begin_inset Formula $\lambda_{\pi}E_{\overline{\pi}}v+(1-\lambda_{\pi})E_{\underline{\pi}}v=E_{\lambda_{\pi}\overline{\pi}+(1-\lambda_{\pi})\underline{\pi}}v$
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Since 
